Changes, all in plugin/server.ts and marked "PATCHED(dispatch)" (see README.md and
patches/upstream-to-patched.diff):
   1. a role ping is not addressed
   2. access.json: a thread's own entry is read before its parent channel's
   3. messages not addressed to the bot are tagged addressed="no" (no ack reaction, no typing indicator)
   4. other bots and webhooks are delivered only when allowlisted; no bot-to-bot reply loops
   5. bare PR numbers become links (when DISCORD_PR_REPO is set)
   6. a conversation stays open while the bot is in it (engaged.json)
   7. bot replies are rare (time-limited, logged reply windows)
   8. a forwarded message arrives with its text
   9. long replies split at words; files go with the last part
  10. a signed bot message listed in on_behalf.json is treated as its person asking
